  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nNo basic attack. Deal 18
    contact damage; gain 1 more per injury this wave, up to 20.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE
    OWNED\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA burrower whose spines protected a community through a
    siege. They are learning to let friends close without remaining on guard. They
    want one full night's sleep while somebody else takes watch.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo
    additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed
    memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly
    stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: gift /
    nursery / special reward; not ordinary shop stock.\r\nBonds: archive, horn. Immortal.
    Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless
    the talent forbids it."
